      "pack_strips_formula": "=C*E*F",
      "upper_qty_formula": "sum matching pack G cells"
    },
    "note": "2026-08-14 版式权威=C26079 母版；不以 C26089 生成件沉淀。字段值走 packing_standards。"
  },
